The '''Bilgerat Compound''' is a pirate holdout located on one of the northern islands of [[Balor]]. It is occupied by the [[Bilgerat]] pirates of [[Plunder Isle]], who sought to enrich themselves from the ruins of [[Stormwrought Castle]]. However, Captain [[Barbaros]] and several of his crew ran afoul of the [[orc]]s of the [[Stormreaver clan]] that had returned to Balor, being taken captive within the castle.

The [[Logbook of The Rat's Nest]] can be found in the captain's quarters aboard the ship.

